Third-party protocol references and prior art
---------------------------------------------

The Quick Share / Nearby Share wire-protocol implementation is informed by
publicly available documentation and open-source reference material, including:

  * NearDrop by @grishka — protocol documentation
    https://github.com/grishka/NearDrop/blob/master/PROTOCOL.md
    (reference documentation; no NearDrop source is included in this project)

  * Google UKEY2 — handshake specification
    https://github.com/google/ukey2

  * Google "Nearby Connections" / Quick Share wire behaviour, as observed
    through interoperability testing with stock Android implementations.

Google Sans Flex / Inter font assets are provided at runtime by the Google Play
Services Downloadable Fonts provider on devices that have it; no font binaries
are bundled in this repository. The font-provider certificates in
app/src/main/res/values/font_certs.xml are the standard Android Studio
downloadable-font template values.

